{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "port_developers_adoption",
  "spec": ["port-developers 3", "port-developers 4.1", "port-developers 4.2", "port-developers 12"],
  "description": "Section 12 test 3. Init (the base first, section 3, PD10) registers the agent cSC4PortDeveloper at level 6 with flags 2, then the subclass creates the department (0x6A4119F0, group 0xAA369059, name 0x6A3FF01C/0xEA493564, maximum funding 1.2, line 1). A building of group 0x1508 inserted on a phase-1 small-airport lot is adopted at stage 0 and line 1's full expenses become 700. A phase-2 lot, a preview occupant, an occupant of another group or type, and a lot whose configuration is no type's stage-0 configuration add nothing. [quirk] An occupant inserted twice is adopted twice.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "pd_create", "kind": "airport"},
    {"op": "pd_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "add_agent", "name": "cSC4PortDeveloper", "level": 6, "flags": 2}, {"event": "create_department", "id": "0x6A4119F0", "group": "0xAA369059", "name_group": "0x6A3FF01C", "name": "0xEA493564", "max": 1.2, "line": 1}]},
    {"op": "pd_expect", "state": {"initialized": true, "department": "0xD", "types": 3}},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x10", "config": ["0xCA2436C0", 1], "x": 3, "z": 4, "rect": [3, 4, 7, 6]},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x100", "lot": "0x10"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x100"},
    {"op": "pd_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "full_expenses", "value": 700}]},
    {"op": "pd_expect_port", "index": 0, "state": {"stage": 0, "type": 0, "x": 3, "z": 4, "lot": "0x10", "efficiency": 1.0, "usage": 0, "needs_lookup": false}},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x11", "config": ["0xCA2436C1", 2], "x": 9, "z": 9},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x101", "lot": "0x11"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x101"},
    {"op": "pd_lot", "lot": "0x12", "config": ["0xCA2436C0", 1], "x": 20, "z": 20},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x102", "lot": "0x12", "preview": true},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x102"},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x103", "lot": "0x12", "group": "0x1509"},
    {"op": "pd_message", "msg": "0x99EF1142", "data": "0x103"},
    {"op": "pd_occupant", "occupant": "0x104", "lot": "0x12", "type": "0xA823821E"},
